{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">楊茜堯日前（30日）生日，除了獲老公羅子溢及一眾好友溫馨慶生外，大女「小珍珠」亦正式幼稚園畢業，並於今日開學日強勢升讀星級名校小學，一家四口幸福滿瀉。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f7d7da96-bf3f-4aec-a8f6-36441933db5d.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026hJPI2BNtPJ1788252734.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f7d7da96-bf3f-4aec-a8f6-36441933db5d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">踏入9月開學大日子，楊茜堯早前在社交網分享了與「小珍珠」影畢業相的溫馨片段，記錄囡囡由初生嬰兒一路蛻變成幼稚園畢業生的珍貴點滴。穿上畢業袍、戴上四方帽的小珍珠，五官非常精緻，笑容甜美可愛，完美遺傳了父母的優良基因。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">片中小珍珠在草地上興奮拋起四方帽，又與弟弟牽手歡樂奔跑，一家人拍下多張全家福，隔住個 Mon 都感受到那份溫馨喜悅。據悉，小珍珠剛從備受星爸星媽追捧的新加坡國際學校（SISHK）幼稚園部順利畢業，今日開學將直接升讀該校的小學部，開展人生新階段。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"91b3df43-bd5e-4689-8227-8cc60b445b7d.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20260iSI6uEIcr1788252735.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"91b3df43-bd5e-4689-8227-8cc60b445b7d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2df8f947-e184-468d-8504-a6d82d05ff98.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026hLfM0WJODF1788252734.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2df8f947-e184-468d-8504-a6d82d05ff98.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"88785666-422e-463e-b5f1-e2c95b138e25.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026PIhxj2pf3n1788252734.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"88785666-422e-463e-b5f1-e2c95b138e25.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除了見證囡囡畢業，楊茜堯亦度過了一個充滿愛的生日。她分享了多張慶生靚相，原來她與圈中好友周勵淇是同日壽星，兩人齊齊切蛋糕慶祝，相當熱鬧。除了有老公羅子溢和經理人陪伴，她更收到靚靚花束、多個生日蛋糕，以及一對寶貝仔女親手畫的生日卡，絕對甜入心。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">楊茜堯感性發文：「又大一歲🎂感恩在身邊一直陪伴自己的家人和朋友❤️ 人生不須要很多轟轟烈烈嘅瞬間，平平淡淡，家人朋友平安健康，就是最好的禮物。珍惜當下❤️」這番簡單而溫暖的宣言，隨即獲陳煒、陳敏之、陳自瑤和姚子羚等圈中好友留言送上滿滿祝福！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T09:19:29.639301+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":549,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}